{"id":"onakke-catacomb","name":"Onakke Catacomb","type":"location","aliases":["the catacomb","the mausoleum","the tomb"],"description":"An ancient catacomb or temple on Shandalar where the Chain Veil lay, partly crumbled after Liliana's battle with Garruk.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2014-07-01","last_seen":"2014-07-01","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Veil of Deceit","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2014-07-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Veil of Deceit\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Jul 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"veil-deceit-2014-07-01-e3","summary":"At the catacomb Liliana kills a guarding angel, who warns her of the Onakke and that she is a vessel.","participants":["liliana-vess","chain-veil","onakke-catacomb"],"location":"onakke-catacomb","importance":"major","page":"stories/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","order":200,"story_date":"2014-07-01","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":40,"quote":"She punctuated her words with a killing wave of raw necromantic power that flayed flesh from the angel's bones","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=She%20punctuated%20her%20words,from%20the%20angel%27s%20bones","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Veil of Deceit","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2014-07-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=She%20punctuated%20her%20words,from%20the%20angel%27s%20bones","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Veil of Deceit\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Jul 2014."}},{"id":"veil-deceit-2014-07-01-e4","summary":"Liliana's tattoos bleed as the Onakke voices fall silent, and she sees a vision of the Onakke city in which a purplish cloud obliterates the ogres.","participants":["liliana-vess","onakke","raven-man"],"location":"onakke-catacomb","importance":"major","page":"stories/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","order":200,"story_date":"2014-07-01","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"A cascade of meteors streaked across the sky as the Onakke were utterly obliterated before her eyes.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=A%20cascade%20of%20meteors,obliterated%20before%20her%20eyes.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Veil of Deceit","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2014-07-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=A%20cascade%20of%20meteors,obliterated%20before%20her%20eyes.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Veil of Deceit\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Jul 2014."}},{"id":"veil-deceit-2014-07-01-e5","summary":"Liliana tries to return the Chain Veil to its altar but cannot let go of it.","participants":["liliana-vess","chain-veil"],"location":"onakke-catacomb","importance":"major","page":"stories/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","order":200,"story_date":"2014-07-01","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":83,"quote":"She tried to open her hand, to let the thing drop, but her fingers wouldn't obey her will.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=She%20tried%20to%20open,wouldn%27t%20obey%20her%20will.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Veil of Deceit","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2014-07-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=She%20tried%20to%20open,wouldn%27t%20obey%20her%20will.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Veil of Deceit\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Jul 2014."}},{"id":"veil-deceit-2014-07-01-e6","summary":"Liliana raises an Onakke skeleton to take the veil, but it will not leave and she destroys it; the veil ends up hanging from her arm.","participants":["liliana-vess","chain-veil","onakke"],"location":"onakke-catacomb","importance":"minor","page":"stories/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","order":200,"story_date":"2014-07-01","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":97,"quote":"She stared at the veil in horror as bones clattered to the floor all around her.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=She%20stared%20at%20the,floor%20all%20around%20her.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Veil of Deceit","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2014-07-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=She%20stared%20at%20the,floor%20all%20around%20her.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Veil of Deceit\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Jul 2014."}},{"id":"veil-deceit-2014-07-01-e7","summary":"An Onakke spirit calls her vessel and tells her the root planted when she killed her brother will bloom into destruction; it also says she acts to avoid following Josu into the void.","participants":["liliana-vess","onakke","josu-vess","chain-veil"],"location":"onakke-catacomb","importance":"major","page":"stories/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","order":200,"story_date":"2014-07-01","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":128,"quote":"Everything you've done has been to avoid following Josu into the void.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=Everything%20you%27ve%20done%20has,Josu%20into%20the%20void.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Veil of Deceit","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2014-07-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=Everything%20you%27ve%20done%20has,Josu%20into%20the%20void.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Veil of Deceit\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Jul 2014."}},{"id":"veil-deceit-2014-07-01-e8","summary":"Liliana drains the Chain Veil's power to extinguish the Onakke spirit at great pain but still cannot drop the veil.","participants":["liliana-vess","onakke","chain-veil"],"location":"onakke-catacomb","importance":"major","page":"stories/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","order":200,"story_date":"2014-07-01","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":130,"quote":"And like a snuffed candle flame, the spirit vanished.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=And%20like%20a%20snuffed,flame%2C%20the%20spirit%20vanished.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Veil of Deceit","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2014-07-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/veil-deceit-2014-07-01#:~:text=And%20like%20a%20snuffed,flame%2C%20the%20spirit%20vanished.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Veil of Deceit\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Jul 2014."}}],"relations":[],"pages_say":[{"page":"stories/veil-deceit-2014-07-01","order":200,"story_date":"2014-07-01","presence":"appears","source":"wizards","description":"An ancient catacomb or temp